function adminText(key){const fallback=adminTextFields.find(x=>x[0]===key)?.[2]||'';return state.adminText?.[key]??(key==='title'||key==='entryButton'?state.siteText?.adminTitle:undefined)??fallback;}
function editAdminText(){const optional=new Set(['subtitle','warehouseDescription','customFieldsDescription']);modal('修改後台文字',adminTextFields.map(([key,label,value,max])=>field(label,key,adminText(key),(optional.has(key)?'':'required ')+'maxlength="'+max+'"')).join(''),'儲存後台文字',fd=>{const next={};for(const [key,label,value,max] of adminTextFields){next[key]=String(fd.get(key)||'').trim();if(!optional.has(key)&&!next[key])error('請填寫'+label+'。');if(next[key].length>max)error(label+'最多 '+max+' 字。');}state.adminText={...state.adminText,...next};addAudit('修改後台文字','更新管理後台的標題、說明與按鈕','管理後台');persist();$('#modal').close();renderAdmin();toast('後台文字已儲存');});}
function renderAdmin(){
 if(!cloudReady)return;const c=draftConfig();
 $('#app').innerHTML='<header class="header"><div class="brand">'+esc(adminText('title'))+'</div><div class="header-actions"><a href="#warehouse">'+esc(adminText('backButton'))+'</a></div></header><main><h1>'+esc(adminText('title'))+'</h1><p class="muted">'+esc(adminText('subtitle'))+'</p><div class="admin-actions">'+button(esc(adminText('websiteTextButton')),'admin-text')+button(esc(adminText('adminTextButton')),'admin-text-settings')+button(esc(adminText('exportAllButton')),'export-all')+button(esc(adminText('importButton')),'import-data')+'</div><details class="admin-card"><summary><h2>'+esc(adminText('warehouseTitle'))+'</h2><span>'+esc(adminText('expandLabel'))+'</span></summary><div class="admin-card-body"><p>'+esc(adminText('warehouseDescription'))+'</p><div class="admin-actions"><a href="#warehouse">'+esc(adminText('openWarehouseButton'))+'</a>'+button('修改庫房管理文字','edit-warehouse-text')+button(esc(adminText('exportWarehouseButton')),'export-warehouse-admin')+'</div></div></details><details class="admin-card"><summary><h2>'+esc(adminText('customFieldsTitle'))+'</h2><span>'+esc(adminText('expandLabel'))+'</span></summary><div class="admin-card-body"><p>'+esc(adminText('customFieldsDescription'))+'</p>'+c.fields.map((f,i)=>'<div class="admin-row"><strong>'+esc(f.label)+'</strong><span>'+esc(f.scope==='project'?'專案':'零件')+' · '+esc({text:'文字',number:'數字',date:'日期',select:'選單'}[f.type])+'</span><button data-field-edit="'+i+'">編輯</button><button data-field-up="'+i+'">上移</button><button data-field-delete="'+i+'">移除</button></div>').join('')+'<div class="admin-actions">'+button(esc(adminText('addFieldButton')),'add-field')+'</div></div></details><details class="admin-card"><summary><h2>'+esc(adminText('pagesTitle'))+'</h2><span>'+esc(adminText('expandLabel'))+'</span></summary><div class="admin-card-body">'+c.pages.map((p,i)=>'<div class="admin-row"><strong>'+esc(p.title)+'</strong><button data-page-edit="'+i+'">編輯內容</button><button data-page-up="'+i+'">上移</button><button data-page-delete="'+i+'">移除</button></div>').join('')+'<div class="admin-actions">'+button(esc(adminText('addPageButton')),'add-page')+'</div></div></details><div class="admin-actions">'+button(esc(adminText('previewButton')),'preview-site')+'<button class="primary" id="publish-site">'+esc(adminText('publishButton'))+'</button></div></main>';
 $('#admin-text').onclick=()=>editSiteText('global');$('#admin-text-settings').onclick=editAdminText;$('#edit-warehouse-text').onclick=()=>editSiteText('warehouse');$('#export-all').onclick=()=>downloadJSON(state,'庫房_完整備份.json');$('#import-data').onclick=importData;$('#export-warehouse-admin').onclick=exportWarehouse;$('#add-field').onclick=()=>editField();$('#add-page').onclick=()=>editPage();
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-field-edit]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>editField(+e.dataset.fieldEdit));
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-page-edit]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>editPage(+e.dataset.pageEdit));
 for(const kind of ['field','page'])for(const action of ['up','delete'])document.querySelectorAll('[data-'+kind+'-'+action+']').forEach(e=>e.onclick=async()=>{const n=Number(e.getAttribute('data-'+kind+'-'+action)),d=draftConfig(),a=d[kind==='field'?'fields':'pages'];if(action==='up'&&n>0)[a[n-1],a[n]]=[a[n],a[n-1]];if(action==='delete'){if(!(await confirmAction('確定從網站草稿移除？')))return;a.splice(n,1);}saveConfig(d);});
 $('#preview-site').onclick=()=>renderContent(null,true);$('#publish-site').onclick=()=>{const d=draftConfig();for(const p of d.pages)for(const b of p.blocks)if(b.type==='button'&&b.action==='page'&&!d.pages.some(p=>p.id===b.target))return toast('有按鈕連到已移除的頁面，請先修改。');state.contentPublished=d;persist();toast('網站設定已發布');};cloudBar();
}
function editField(index){const c=draftConfig(),f=c.fields[index]||{id:crypto.randomUUID(),label:'',type:'text',scope:'project',options:[]};modal(index===undefined?'新增欄位':'編輯欄位',field('欄位名稱','label',f.label,'required maxlength="60"')+'<label class="field">位置<select name="scope">'+['project','part'].map(v=>'<option value="'+v+'" '+(f.scope===v?'selected':'')+'>'+({project:'專案',part:'零件'}[v])+'</option>').join('')+'</select></label><label class="field">類型<select name="type">'+['text','number','date','select'].map(v=>'<option value="'+v+'" '+(f.type===v?'selected':'')+'>'+({text:'文字',number:'數字',date:'日期',select:'選單'}[v])+'</option>').join('')+'</select></label>'+field('選單選項（用逗號分隔）','options',(f.options||[]).join(',')),'儲存草稿',fd=>{const label=fd.get('label').trim();if(!label)error('請填寫欄位名稱');const next={...f,label,type:fd.get('type'),scope:fd.get('scope'),options:fd.get('options').split(/[,，]/).map(s=>s.trim()).filter(Boolean)};if(next.type==='select'&&!next.options.length)error('請填寫選單選項');if(index===undefined)c.fields.push(next);else c.fields[index]=next;$('#modal').close();saveConfig(c);});}
function editPage(index){const c=draftConfig(),p=c.pages[index]||{id:crypto.randomUUID(),title:'',blocks:[]};modal('頁面設定',field('頁面名稱','title',p.title,'required maxlength="60"'),'儲存並編輯區塊',fd=>{p.title=fd.get('title').trim();if(!p.title)error('請填寫名稱');if(index===undefined)c.pages.push(p);else c.pages[index]=p;$('#modal').close();saveConfig(c);openBlocks(p.id);});}
function openBlocks(id){const p=draftConfig().pages.find(p=>p.id===id);$('#app').innerHTML='<header class="header"><div class="brand">'+esc(p.title)+'</div><button id="back-admin">返回後台</button></header><main><h1>編輯頁面區塊</h1>'+p.blocks.map((b,i)=>'<section class="admin-card"><strong>'+esc(b.type==='text'?'文字區塊':'按鈕')+'</strong><p class="content-block">'+esc(b.text||b.label)+'</p><div class="admin-actions"><button data-block-edit="'+i+'">編輯</button><button data-block-up="'+i+'">上移</button><button data-block-delete="'+i+'">移除</button></div></section>').join('')+'<div class="admin-actions">'+button('＋ 文字區塊','add-text')+button('＋ 按鈕','add-button')+'</div></main>';$('#back-admin').onclick=renderAdmin;$('#add-text').onclick=()=>editBlock(id,undefined,'text');$('#add-button').onclick=()=>editBlock(id,undefined,'button');document.querySelectorAll('[data-block-edit]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>editBlock(id,+e.dataset.blockEdit));for(const action of ['up','delete'])document.querySelectorAll('[data-block-'+action+']').forEach(e=>e.onclick=async()=>{const c=draftConfig(),a=c.pages.find(p=>p.id===id).blocks,n=+e.getAttribute('data-block-'+action);if(action==='up'&&n>0)[a[n-1],a[n]]=[a[n],a[n-1]];if(action==='delete'){if(!(await confirmAction('確定移除此區塊？')))return;a.splice(n,1);}state.contentDraft=c;persist();openBlocks(id);});cloudBar();}
function editBlock(id,index,type){const c=draftConfig(),p=c.pages.find(p=>p.id===id),b=p.blocks[index]||{id:crypto.randomUUID(),type,text:'',label:'',action:'warehouse',target:''};modal('編輯區塊',b.type==='text'?'<label class="field">文字內容<textarea name="text" rows="8" maxlength="10000">'+esc(b.text)+'</textarea></label>':field('按鈕名稱','label',b.label,'required maxlength="60"')+'<label class="field">按鈕用途<select name="action">'+[['warehouse','開啟庫房'],['new-project','建立專案'],['page','開啟自訂頁面'],['link','開啟網址']].map(([v,l])=>'<option value="'+v+'" '+(v===b.action?'selected':'')+'>'+l+'</option>').join('')+'</select></label><label class="field">自訂頁面<select name="page">'+c.pages.map(x=>'<option value="'+esc(x.id)+'" '+(x.id===b.target?'selected':'')+'>'+esc(x.title)+'</option>').join('')+'</select></label>'+field('網址（開啟網址時填寫）','url',b.action==='link'?b.target:'','type="url"'),'儲存草稿',fd=>{let next={...b};if(b.type==='text')next.text=fd.get('text');else{next.label=fd.get('label').trim();next.action=fd.get('action');next.target=next.action==='page'?fd.get('page'):next.action==='link'?fd.get('url').trim():'';if(!next.label)error('請填寫按鈕名稱');if(next.action==='link'&&!/^https?:\/\//i.test(next.target))error('請輸入 http:// 或 https:// 網址');}if(index===undefined)p.blocks.push(next);else p.blocks[index]=next;state.contentDraft=c;persist();$('#modal').close();openBlocks(id);});}
function renderContent(id,preview=false){const c=preview?draftConfig():config(),p=c.pages.find(p=>p.id===id)||c.pages[0];$('#app').innerHTML='<header class="header"><div class="brand">'+esc(siteText('brand'))+'</div><div class="header-actions"><a href="#warehouse">庫房</a><button id="content-admin">'+esc(adminText('entryButton'))+'</button></div></header><main>'+(preview?'<div class="preview-note">草稿預覽，尚未發布</div>':'')+'<nav class="site-nav">'+c.pages.map(x=>'<button data-view-page="'+esc(x.id)+'">'+esc(x.title)+'</button>').join('')+'</nav>'+(p?'<h1>'+esc(p.title)+'</h1>'+p.blocks.map((b,i)=>b.type==='text'?'<div class="content-block">'+esc(b.text)+'</div>':'<div class="content-block"><button data-run-block="'+i+'">'+esc(b.label)+'</button></div>').join(''):'<p>尚無自訂頁面。請先在後台新增。</p>')+'</main>';$('#content-admin').onclick=renderAdmin;document.querySelectorAll('[data-view-page]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>renderContent(e.dataset.viewPage,preview));document.querySelectorAll('[data-run-block]').forEach(e=>e.onclick=()=>{const b=p.blocks[+e.dataset.runBlock];if(b.action==='page')renderContent(b.target,preview);else if(b.action==='link'&&/^https?:\/\//i.test(b.target))window.open(b.target,'_blank','noopener,noreferrer');else if(preview)toast('預覽模式不執行庫房操作');else{location.hash='';render();if(b.action==='new-project')newProject();}});cloudBar();}
function customControl(f,value,name){if(f.type==='select')return '<select name="'+esc(name)+'"><option value="">未選擇</option>'+[...new Set([...(f.options||[]),...(value?[String(value)]:[])])].map(o=>'<option '+(String(value)===o?'selected':'')+'>'+esc(o)+'</option>').join('')+'</select>';return '<input name="'+esc(name)+'" type="'+f.type+'" value="'+esc(value??'')+'" '+(f.type==='number'?'step="any"':'')+'>';}
function enhanceWarehouse(){const c=config(),main=$('main');if(!main)return;if(c.pages.length){const nav=document.createElement('nav');nav.className='site-nav';nav.innerHTML=c.pages.map(p=>'<button data-nav-page="'+esc(p.id)+'">'+esc(p.title)+'</button>').join('');main.prepend(nav);nav.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{captureDraft();location.hash='page/'+b.dataset.navPage;});}const p=project(),form=$('#receipt-form');if(!p||!form)return;const fields=c.fields; if(!fields.length)return;const wrap=document.createElement('div');wrap.className='admin-card';wrap.innerHTML='<h2>自訂資料</h2>'+fields.filter(f=>f.scope==='project').map(f=>'<label class="field">'+esc(f.label)+customControl(f,p.custom?.[f.id],'custom:'+f.id)+'</label>').join('')+p.parts.map(i=>{const a=fields.filter(f=>f.scope==='part');return a.length?'<h3>'+esc(i.name)+'</h3>'+a.map(f=>'<label class="field">'+esc(f.label)+customControl(f,i.custom?.[f.id],'custom:'+i.id+':'+f.id)+'</label>').join(''):'';}).join('')+'<button type="button" id="save-custom">儲存自訂資料</button>';form.append(wrap);$('#save-custom').onclick=()=>{const fd=new FormData(form),updates=[];for(const f of fields)for(const item of f.scope==='project'?[p]:p.parts){let value=fd.get(f.scope==='project'?'custom:'+f.id:'custom:'+item.id+':'+f.id);if(f.type==='number'&&value!==''){value=Number(value);if(!Number.isFinite(value)){toast('請填寫有效數字');return;}}updates.push([item,f.id,value]);}captureDraft();for(const [item,id,value]of updates){item.custom??={};item.custom[id]=value;}persist();toast('自訂資料已儲存');};}
function importData(){let parsed=null;modal('匯入舊資料','<p>只追加編號不重複的專案；遇到相同編號會停止，不覆蓋雲端庫存。先下載原始備份再確認。</p><div class="admin-actions">'+button('讀取這個瀏覽器的舊資料','read-local')+'</div><label class="field">或選擇 JSON 備份<input type="file" id="json-import" accept=".json"></label><div id="import-summary"></div>','確認追加到雲端',()=>{if(!parsed)error('請先讀取資料');const candidate=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state)),ids=new Set([...candidate.projects,...(candidate.deletedProjects||[]).map(x=>x.project)].map(p=>p.id));for(const p of [...parsed.projects,...(parsed.deletedProjects||[]).map(x=>x.project)]){if(ids.has(p.id))error('編號 '+p.id+' 已存在，未匯入任何資料。');ids.add(p.id);}candidate.projects.push(...parsed.projects);candidate.deletedProjects=[...(candidate.deletedProjects||[]),...(parsed.deletedProjects||[])];candidate.logs=[...(candidate.logs||[]),...(parsed.logs||[])];saveEditState(candidate);done('舊資料已追加');});function load(text){parsed=null;try{const data=JSON.parse(text);if(!Array.isArray(data.projects))throw Error('不是庫房備份');for(const p of [...data.projects,...(data.deletedProjects||[]).map(x=>x.project)]){p.archivedParts??=[];p.location??=[...new Set((p.baskets||[]).map(b=>b.slot).filter(Boolean))].join('、');p.inventory??=Object.fromEntries(p.parts.map(i=>[i.id,(p.baskets||[]).reduce((s,b)=>s+Number(b.stock?.[i.id]||0),0)]));for(const i of p.parts)i.sets??=1;}parsed=data;$('#import-summary').textContent='已讀取 '+data.projects.length+' 個專案。請確認是否包含示範專案。';downloadJSON(data,'庫房_匯入前原始備份.json');}catch(e){$('#form-error').textContent=e.message;}}$('#read-local').onclick=()=>load(localStorage.getItem('project-warehouse-v1')||'{}');$('#json-import').onchange=async e=>{const f=e.target.files[0];if(f&&f.size<=1500000)load(await f.text());else $('#form-error').textContent='檔案須小於 1.5 MB';};}
function routeAdmin(){if(!cloudReady)return;if(location.hash==='#admin')renderAdmin();else if(location.hash.startsWith('#page/'))renderContent(location.hash.slice(6));else render();}
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>routeAdmin());
